{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのも早いもので‥‥\n私はこの前まで広島で家族や友達と過ごしていたのに、親元を離れ1人で東京に来て\n乃木坂46のおかげ みんなに出会えたおかげでたくさんのことを経験出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も沢山の方と出会えて、沢山のお仕事をさせていただいて、\nレギュラー番組も沢山持たせて頂いて、雑誌にも出させて頂いて‥‥\n初めてのこと沢山で、\n辛いこともいぃ～ぱい！いぃぱいっあったけど\n支えてもらったり、声をかけてもらったりして、\n全部ひっくるめると 最高の1年でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは私の大切な家族や、裏で一生懸命サポートして下さるスタッフさんがいたから、\n相談事にも乗ってくれる最高の友達がいるから！\n何よりも私の笑顔の源のみなさまがいたからです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。なんか恥ずかしいけど\nみんなだいすきぃ～(*'▽'*)♪ほんとにありがとうございました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈が体調不良で急遽私は、きぃとひなぴょんのレーンに参加しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごいホワッホワで楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん！モデルさんデビューおめでとう（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょんの かわごちょっぷ！はうけた？笑ひなぴょんもモデルさんで可愛いです（≧∇≦）\nいいなぁ素敵素敵～(*'▽'*)♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんファンの皆さん！ひなぴょんファンの皆さん！まあやと楽しく握手してくれてありがとうございました！^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやに会いに来てくれた皆さん！いつもありがとうございます！大好き～(^O^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈のファンの皆さんも\n心配だったよね\n今日は元気そうだったからひとまず安心です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の名古屋での握手会はメンバー全員完売が出て...ホント皆さんに感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの方や、遠くから来てくれた方や、いつも会いに来てくれる方、本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはとっても楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年会えるのは最後だったから沢山来てくれて嬉しかったです！（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別の服はこれ♡大好きな 友達のママからのプレゼントです！^^*イェーイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか？\n髪型もアップにしてみたよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラブベリーみてくれたかな？\n女の子っぽい可愛い服も、いつもとちょっと違ったメイクも出来て楽しかった♪\nスタッフの方も凄く褒めてくださいました（≧∇≦）お世辞でも嬉しいし、とっても楽しい時間でした。\nまたお仕事でご一緒出来るといいな♡\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.も撮影してもらいました！\nとってもとってもさいこーなパーティーって感じの撮影でした～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいのがきっと伝わる写真になってます^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポーカーフェイスさんにも撮っていただきました～！^^*沢山雑誌に出させてもらいました。\nみんなのおかげです。ありがとうございます！（≧∇≦）m(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はRの法則～(*'▽'*)♪\n６期生生放送にでた女子で放送前ご飯食べたよー\n楽しかった～(*'▽'*)♪年明け遊ぶ約束もしましたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ったら報告するね～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもレギュラーのぎえいごも年末12月31もあるからみてね^^*\nゴルフのも是非是非チェックしてねっ(*¨*)乃木坂工事中もよろしくお願いしますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんとの乃木坂としての残りの時間も大切に過ごしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も、どこの場所に居てもみつけてもらえるよう！全力で頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今よりもっと笑顔が届けれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが健康で笑顔の1年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は今年最後の仕事紅白だぁ～(*'▽'*)♪\nBYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/30/4738880/0019.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}